-- map icons, read when the world map needs them. D.SPOT[id] = where its objectives are done, D.START[id] = where the
-- item that starts it drops: spots "kind,slot,map,x,y,r,src[,name]" joined by ";". kind: k kill, c collect (a creature's
-- drop or a chest's loot), u use an object (or cast on a creature), b buy from a vendor, e explore or an event, f fishing,
-- pickpocketing or skinning, s where the item that starts the quest drops; slot: 1-4 the creature or object objective,
-- 5-8 the item objective (its ReqItem slot + 4), 0 none; map: the uiMap it is drawn on; x, y: permille of that map;
-- r: radius in permille of the map's width (0 a point); src: c CMaNGOS spawns, p a CMaNGOS quest POI (both Classic data),
-- w Wowhead Forever, g players' games (slot 0 where no slot of the catalog's was found for it); name: an index into
